### Phase 1: Clean, evidence-first baseline

Goal:
A user asks questions over one authorized clean PDF and receives only
source-supported answers with correct page citations.

Build:

- One clean, authorized source PDF
- Page-by-page extraction
- OCR fallback if needed
- Metadata storage
- Page-aware chunks
