## 16. Current immediate objective

The immediate objective is NOT to create the full production platform.

The immediate objective is:

> Ingest one authorized Hindi or bilingual Shantikunj PDF correctly,
> preserve page-level provenance, retrieve correct evidence for 20–50
> realistic questions, generate only source-supported answers, and display
> backend-verified citations.

Completion criteria for the first milestone:

- One authorized PDF ingested
- Every chunk has stable source metadata and page range
- Hindi text extraction is manually verified on representative pages
- Poor OCR content is blocked or flagged
- At least 20–50 evaluation questions exist
- Retrieval quality is measured at Hit@1, Hit@3, and Hit@5
- Unsupported questions result in safe abstention
- Answers cite only retrieved and validated chunks
- The API returns book/chapter/section/page source information
- No secrets are exposed in frontend or source control

Always select the smallest next task that moves the system toward this
milestone. Do not expand scope prematurely.3